{
  "job_B9.2.6_20251003_115001": {
    "chunk_text": "wundor on monegum londum. An w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t mon geseah swelce an fyren hring nor\u00f0an cumen mid micle swege. O\u00feer wear\u00fe on Tarentan \u00fe\u00e6re byrig \u00e6t anre feorme: \u00feonne mon \u00fea hlafas wrat to \u00feicgeanne, \u00de\u00e6t \u00feridde w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t hit hagolade seofon niht, d\u00e6ges & nihtes, ofer ealle Romane. & on Somnia \u00fe\u00e6m londe seo eor\u00fee tob\u00e6rst, & \u00feonan up w\u00e6s biernende fyr wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s hefones. & mon geseah swelce hit w\u00e6re an gylden hring on heofonum br\u00e6dre \u00feonne sunne; & w\u00e6s from On \u00fe\u00e6re tide Pincente \u00fe\u00e6t folc, & Uestine, & Marse, & Peligni, & Marrucine, & Somnite, & On \u00f0\u00e6m dagum aweddon \u00fea nietenu & \u00fea hundas \u00fee w\u00e6ron on Somnitum. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m gefeaht Pompeius se consul wi\u00f0 eal \u00fea folc, & gefliemed wear\u00fe. & Iulius se cesar gefeaht wi\u00f0 Marse \u00fe\u00e6m folce, & gefliemed wear\u00f0. Ra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s Iulius gefeaht wi\u00f0 Somnitum, & wi\u00f0 Lucanum, & hie gefliemde. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m hiene mon het casere. \u00dea b\u00e6d he \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00feone triumphan him ongean brohte. \u00dea sende him mon ane blace hacelan angean, him on bismer, for triumphan. & eft hie him sendon ane tunecan ongean, \u00fea \u00fee hie toge heton, \u00fe\u00e6t he ealles buton arunge to \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Silla se consul, Pompeiuses gefera, gefeaht wi\u00f0 Esernium \u00fe\u00e6m folce",
